[{"id":"m_9e61c2427f899ead0c6f","expressionId":"x_2c9f6f9e513d32555fa6","language":"ja","text":"（客観的判断として）...しなければならない / （指示して）...してください / ...であるに違いない","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_10d93dd04a61af5ce024","expressionId":"x_5b87de02aa741b042511","language":"ja","text":"(名に対する)姓","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_0e5ff0bcede6319e2c16","expressionId":"x_0aaa047508112ac8288d","language":"ja","text":"『百貨店』,『デパート』","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_a13f55ae57b9794550e4","expressionId":"x_042252015150169fda07","language":"ja","text":"『だれも』…『ない』","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_79be0b1a7b2ef21193c2","expressionId":"x_df9d79f52caf03d49cd1","language":"ja","text":"警察署","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_3f462848bcc774182848","expressionId":"x_a31369c726970cbb1d48","language":"ja","text":"〈C〉水着([[swimsuit]])","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_854df6ff23d132600a77","expressionId":"x_2961a6d1c8dcd6244dd8","language":"ja","text":"...によると, ...によれば / ...に合わせて, ...に応じて, ...に従って","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_5788575dab8bbbe72dd7","expressionId":"x_6a1a38cbd5ff3bb79284","language":"ja","text":"バーチャル・リアリティ(VR), 仮想現実","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_d684f0ee3419a827360e","expressionId":"x_ec153694483b2b7d1ccc","language":"ja","text":"を設置する / を用意する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_1572cc8425c9e46dda97","expressionId":"x_ea9326c0831b513f8af6","language":"ja","text":"じっと待つ,《くだけた話》ちょっと待って / 《...に》しがみつく,くっついている《to ...》,手放さない","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_ddb85e68851d523b9dd4","expressionId":"x_91a27aaf491e88d00b25","language":"ja","text":"【句動】をまとめる,を要約する,を総括する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_b4af783d76e08ae09310","expressionId":"x_23b3884eafad6033ca88","language":"ja","text":"【句動】を後回しにする,を延期する,を先延ばしにする / の気を悪くさせる, を不快にする,をうんざりさせる","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_e73034d83530b4becda7","expressionId":"x_53a25cb618677731c944","language":"ja","text":"【句動】を停止する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_897a914bb34e0c17d482","expressionId":"x_1d32bf7dc39b4ecfa040","language":"ja","text":"【句動】《...することに》乗り出す,取り掛かる《to do》","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_54a9cf6245fc3a235a34","expressionId":"x_ddf695370a72efec55de","language":"ja","text":"《...によって》（予期せぬことが）起こる《through ...》","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_61e08479d977a01556da","expressionId":"x_0440a227252e901f9524","language":"ja","text":"【句動】（うわさなどが）広まる, （次々と）回る, 動き回る","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_b2955ebc7c6abfed2328","expressionId":"x_0a7895cfc6391aac96b4","language":"ja","text":"【句動】《...に》を次に回す,を順送りにする,を伝える《to ...》 / を継承する,を受け継ぐ /  やめておく, 遠慮する / この世を去る,永眠する（死ぬの婉曲表現）","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_9f497ccb3eaab56d2598","expressionId":"x_2cd723e88a7f58aa8b6c","language":"ja","text":"【句動】をよく調べる,を見てみる /（図書館などから）...を借りる / （ホテルなどから）支払いをして引き払う / （レジ係が）精算する / (急いで)出発する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_f0d52a6c434b82194b98","expressionId":"x_c6f0527acdfbc6de9df9","language":"ja","text":"引き返す, 戻る / 元に戻る, 方針を変える / （人）を引き返させる, （物）を戻す","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_52c44f684335e3cb79b1","expressionId":"x_1cd0a91b4f077ba44506","language":"ja","text":"【名/U】予備 / 支援,応援 / 渋滞【形】予備の / 支援の / 非常用の【句動】後退する;を後退させる / を支援する,を後援する / 裏付ける, の裏付けをする/〜を渋滞させる","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_ab5c0ae85388fd4a90be","expressionId":"x_8236b1047b23d242d052","language":"ja","text":"【句動】（機会・可能性など）が開ける, が広がる / を開く, を広げる / 《...に》心を開く, 打ち解ける《to ...》","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_be8c2f9d172a67e64bb4","expressionId":"x_379952c5a7a5f6b7393e","language":"ja","text":"を実行する,を完了する / を実行に移す,を実施する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_3bc79d4902d35bdd8ffd","expressionId":"x_3907953764c03ded57ba","language":"ja","text":"《be ~ 》...を目的としている, ...向けである","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_9ce8c1761a81c9c2df6b","expressionId":"x_a38f91217547d213b0ff","language":"ja","text":"を引き継ぐ","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_1b2f8032af6e86acb6d3","expressionId":"x_9066644a934104b3e1af","language":"ja","text":"などなど","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_cdf30e227d9e6080e94a","expressionId":"x_2b7c8b878550c34df978","language":"ja","text":"を理解する,をよく考える,を計画する / （身体を）鍛える / 《良くあるいは悪く》起こる,発展する《well / badly 》/ 成功することを証明する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_f5abaffa6b8e513df739","expressionId":"x_8aaf5e76b6032ccb5753","language":"ja","text":"《...に》戻る《to ...》、遡る","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_cece7fb6bf18c9779776","expressionId":"x_ea9326c0831b513f8af6","language":"ja","text":"じっと待つ,《くだけた話》ちょっと待って / 《...に》しがみつく,くっついている《to ...》,手放さない","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_cf8e3ebe6dd4730b944e","expressionId":"x_93faf333c33ed8f558da","language":"ja","text":"...に従って, ...に一致して","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_ac9ea7ebb0e05f3ddb45","expressionId":"x_44653ba9b1e2137e3bde","language":"ja","text":"（人）を訪問する / 《…を》（正式に）（人）に頼む, に求める《for ...》 / 《…してくれるように》（人）に頼む, に求める《to do》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_ec805eb1f8eb2be9dad4","expressionId":"x_76cf78a603b5a5c6b55a","language":"ja","text":"【副】実際には,事実上は【形】（法律･制度などが）発効して, 実施されて","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_c83902c0fd93de301070","expressionId":"x_3bbdaa739119735d26c1","language":"ja","text":"ずっと, はるばる / 完全に, すっかり","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_48a7a64e0f23fb570c8a","expressionId":"x_bb8720cde8554293f71c","language":"ja","text":"しばらくの間, かなり長い間 / これまでかなりの期間《now》/ ここしばらくの間ずっと《past》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_896bf026e0a715a8c96f","expressionId":"x_5e1f68070dc7ed668549","language":"ja","text":"《...の》お返しに, 返事として《for ...》 / 《...の》代わりに《for ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_d5fd273fb916516215ab","expressionId":"x_9efb8d3af81950a6ab26","language":"ja","text":"あらゆる..., いろいろな種類の..., 多くの... / いくらでも...がある /《~ things》なんでもかんでも","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_d50466536d4b8721ef3a","expressionId":"x_169168dd8e66db3f6155","language":"ja","text":"（問題・困難・危険など）に直面して","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_62bea2a9cd588f6bceba","expressionId":"x_845e512e7efb4022f1c3","language":"ja","text":"そうは言っても, だからって,たとえそうであっても / それにもかかわらず","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_c1fd4edfbde3d7ee0917","expressionId":"x_a282c2a83a633c53dd5e","language":"ja","text":"一度に, 連続して","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_ee06741fc57ceacf31c5","expressionId":"x_fb3fa99e0f10d5482811","language":"ja","text":"《否定的文脈で》まして…ない, ...は言うまでもなく, ...はおろか, ...はもちろん","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_f1b4b0d0fe2f94169591","expressionId":"x_537d3b5bf1f7d07b33d4","language":"ja","text":"わざわざ...する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_704fd93de4f6b2af5e80","expressionId":"x_2ed19f1f1c458dbc155c","language":"ja","text":"《be ~》（不愉快な人・物）がなくなって / 《get ~ 》...を捨てる, ...を廃棄する,...を取り除く","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_6df661dbffb6531a0d3a","expressionId":"x_5503d28456dc1a3c0d10","language":"ja","text":"売り物の,売るために,売るための / 売り出し中で","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_9098f0cf52c894a4b07b","expressionId":"x_d598d467fea9389743e7","language":"ja","text":"...にすぎない / （数量の少なさを強調して）たった...","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_fa366ae8b9f6aa0cfc9f","expressionId":"x_966c8b909412b3a6cf99","language":"ja","text":"【形】時代遅れの, 流行遅れの /  一昔前の, 旧式の / 昔懐かしい / 《…に関して》 古い考えの, 時代錯誤の《about ...》/ 古風な, 昔ながらの / （表情が）非難めいた","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_74948e45f765ef5597ff","expressionId":"x_fb4127c07bc552868a80","language":"ja","text":"《否定文･比較節で》...するのを好む, ...するのを欲する 《do》 / 《かたい話・丁寧》《疑問文･否定文･条件節で》 《would ~ do》…することを希望する / 《Would you ~》...したいですか？, ...はいかがですか？, ...しませんか？","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_8558b299dd5bc22d4d2b","expressionId":"x_9791ab33c915a3099909","language":"ja","text":"...を当たり前とみなす, ...を当然と考える / （当たり前として）...を評価しない, ...を軽視する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_0027940c5059786d29ac","expressionId":"x_f21d85913f8c67175ccd","language":"ja","text":"《明確化》つまり,すなわち / （通例末尾で、前文に限定を加えて）と言っても…ならばの話だが / 《訂正・話》いや,というか","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_e5cbdbc6aa381c430ce3","expressionId":"x_78e1c89057739afe0c24","language":"ja","text":"《...に》出る, 外出する,出かける《to ...》 / 《...と》付き合う,交際する《with ...》 / （火などが）消える /  《...に》送られる《to ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_63fa72c72b3bce3c28fe","expressionId":"x_4002db0c1cb0687b4e36","language":"ja","text":"《かたく》...以上のもの, さらなる...","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_637c433298f860064d74","expressionId":"x_2c1c3733626507b9d736","language":"ja","text":"《かたく》すぐに, ただちに / 同時に, 1度に, 一緒に, 一気に","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_81c8f7a53adc8377be8c","expressionId":"x_0590df43c070e0449b68","language":"ja","text":"【名】多過ぎるもの, 余分なもの【形】多すぎる【副】多すぎて","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_77705ac950cf3aca9738","expressionId":"x_e005f4493a6a84060d33","language":"ja","text":"（神･架空の人･奇跡など）の存在を信じる, ...がいると思う / （考え･方針･教義など）を《…として》良いと認める《as ...》 / （人の能力や判断など）を信頼する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_b0d8da06f1dc88ef21e2","expressionId":"x_ab0b3f79d895a337c5d7","language":"ja","text":"《機会・状況・利点・成果などを》利用する《of ...》 / 《失敗・無知・厚意などに》付け込む《of ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_c317884601c7cb2352c4","expressionId":"x_5953bc7b08b6e5119c3f","language":"ja","text":"（自分の意見を述べる場合の）私にとって, 私の中では","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_7e63da965bdcb038c3f4","expressionId":"x_289d24bc4e1d44d8948c","language":"ja","text":"《くだけて》...のこととなると, ...に関しては / ...を処理するとなると","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_54a985523bf5dc6f0771","expressionId":"x_1d44d30ce109c1db94dc","language":"ja","text":"理論的には, 理論上は, 理屈の上では","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_b3607b898d89955edfbd","expressionId":"x_8236fc527db7d46904d5","language":"ja","text":"【名/U】（人の）幸福 / 福利, 健康 / 繁栄 / （国の経済などの）健全性","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_a42f64c9d74fb70b166c","expressionId":"x_ddf74783a6568c47ff2c","language":"ja","text":"二酸化炭素,炭酸ガス","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_061da3c258f57b5989a6","expressionId":"x_187e67d1447f0b4925ea","language":"ja","text":"定冠詞(the)","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_8701f7e56f7c96d72fa3","expressionId":"x_be7e8834209978ddb1f8","language":"ja","text":"確かに,きっと,恐らく","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_460a5f2711b7fa8dff9c","expressionId":"x_664e33e8d315f1189bae","language":"ja","text":"(文法で)第二人称","source":"EJDict"}]